A: How do you say I'm phoning my mum in Russian?
    draw masha masha_name phone_m

    draw tom tom_name

A: Here is how it sounds. Tom drops in: listen first.
    move tom tom_name by [-70,0]

A: Ма́ша, кому́ ты звони́шь?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

B: Ма́ме. А пото́м бра́ту.
    draw balloon caption false

    ask "Who does Masha phone first?" listen "Ма́ме. А пото́м бра́ту." voice b options ["her brother","her mum","her sister"] correct 2
        gloss: Mum. And then my brother.
        right: Her mum first, ма́ме; then her brother, бра́ту.
        wrong: Listen to the first word: ма́ма, with a new end.

    erase balloon

    hide tom tom_name phone_m masha masha_name

A: Кому́ is who, in the to-form: to whom.
    draw ex1 ex2 ex_g

    erase ex1 ex2 ex_g

A: Звони́ть is new: to phone. It goes like говори́ть: звоню́, звони́шь, звони́т.
    draw s1 verb

    draw rule

A: And ма́ма has become ма́ме: in Russian you don't phone someone, you ring to them, so mum takes the to-ending.
    highlight s1_w_3 color #8a5fa8 part е$

    erase s1 verb rule

A: Today: more verbs, all the to-words, and к.
    draw r1_i r1

B: Я пишу́ сестре́.
    draw r2_i r2

    draw pishu

A: Писа́ть: пишу́, пи́шешь, пи́шет; the с turns to ш. The letter goes to my sister: сестре́.
    highlight r2 color #8a5fa8 part е$

    erase pishu

B: Я помога́ю бра́ту.
    draw r3_i r3

A: Помога́ть, to help, goes like чита́ть: помога́ю, помога́ешь.
    draw pomog

    draw not_brata

A: But Russian gives the help to him: бра́ту, not бра́та as after ви́жу.
    highlight r3 color #8a5fa8 part у$

    erase not_brata pomog

    draw r4_i r4

A: And a he-word in ь, like учи́тель, swaps it for ю: я пишу́ учи́телю.
    highlight r4 color #8a5fa8 part ю$

    hide board

A: The to-words in full: мне, тебе́, ему́, ей, вам.
    draw pron_known

A: Two are new: нам, to us, and им, to them.
    draw nam nam_g im im_g

B: Ба́бушка звони́т нам, а мы помога́ем ей.
    draw gran gran_g g1 g2

A: Ба́бушка is grandma, and she goes like ма́ма: ба́бушке.
    highlight g1 color #c9871a part ^Ба́бушка effect underline

    erase pron_known nam nam_g im im_g gran gran_g g1 g2

    draw like0

A: Мне нра́вится was a to-word all along: it pleases to me.
    highlight like0 color #8a5fa8 part ^мне

A: So whoever is pleased takes the to-ending: ма́ме нра́вится чай.
    draw like1

    erase like0 like1

A: Last, lesson thirty-eight's к врачу́: к is to, towards a person, and the person takes the to-ending.
    draw h_person pe1 doc

    erase doc

B: Я иду́ к ма́ме. Я иду́ к бра́ту.
    draw pe2 pe3

    draw h_place pl1 pl2

A: Places take в or на, as in в апте́ку and в шко́лу; people take к.
    highlight pe1 pe2 pe3 color #c9871a part ^к effect underline

    erase h_place h_person pl1 pl2 pe1 pe2 pe3

A: On Saturday Tom meets Masha in the street. Listen, then practise it.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, приве́т! Ты свобо́дна?","gloss":"Masha, hi! Are you free?"},{"by":"b","text":"Нет, я иду́ к ба́бушке. Я ей помога́ю.","gloss":"No, I'm going to grandma's. I help her."},{"by":"a","text":"А я пишу́ сестре́ и звоню́ ма́ме.","gloss":"And I'm writing to my sister and phoning my mum."},{"by":"b","text":"Твоя́ ма́ма в Ло́ндоне?","gloss":"Is your mum in London?"},{"by":"a","text":"Да. Ей нра́вится, когда́ я звоню́.","gloss":"Yes. She likes it when I phone."},{"by":"b","text":"Приве́т ма́ме! Пока́!","gloss":"Say hi to your mum! Bye!"}] practice true size 1.6

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    icon q_ded size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["man"] icon_look picture of "old man"

    quiz "Tom helps his grandad. Я помога́ю ___. Which word fills the gap?" above q_ded reveal.text "Я помога́ю де́душке." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Де́душке: help goes to him, and де́душка ends in а, so е.
        wrong: In Russian the help goes to him, so the to-ending; де́душка ends in а.
        * де́душку
        + де́душке
        * де́душка

    erase q_ded

    icon q_walk size 120 set twemoji x 400 y 470 or ["person walking"] icon_look picture of "woman walking"
    icon q_bro size 120 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["boy","person"] icon_look picture of "person: blond hair"
    text q_bro_l "брат" #8f887c x 620 y 360 font_size 34

    quiz "Masha is going to see her brother. Я иду́ ___ бра́ту. Which word fills the gap?" above ["q_bro_l","q_walk","q_bro"] reveal.text "Я иду́ к бра́ту." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: К: to a person, к; to a place, в or на.
        wrong: Her brother is a person, not a place.
        * в
        * на
        + к

    erase q_walk q_bro q_bro_l

    icon q_gran size 120 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["woman"] icon_look picture of "old woman"
    icon q_cat size 120 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat

    quiz "Grandma likes cats. Which is right?" above ["q_cat","q_gran"] reveal.text "Ба́бушке нра́вятся коты́." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Ба́бушке: whoever is pleased takes the to-ending.
        wrong: Think of мне нра́вится: who is pleased?
        + Ба́бушке нра́вятся коты́.
        * Ба́бушка нра́вятся коты́.
        * Ба́бушку нра́вятся коты́.

    erase q_gran q_cat

    icon q_phone size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["telephone"] icon_look picture of "mobile phone"

    ask "Tom is about to phone his mum. Ask him to say hi to her for you." say_it "Приве́т ма́ме!" gloss "Hi to your mum!" voice b show cue test t1

A: Спаси́бо! Пока́!
    text q_say "— Приве́т ма́ме!   — Спаси́бо! Пока́!" say "Приве́т ма́ме!" say_voice b colors {"е$":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 300 font_size 46

    erase q_phone q_say

    icon q_teach size 120 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["teacher","man"] icon_look picture of "man teacher"
    icon q_env size 120 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["love letter","e-mail"] icon_look picture of envelope

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: I'm writing to the teacher." above ["q_env","q_teach"] answer ["я пишу учителю","пишу учителю"] reveal.text "Я пишу́ учи́телю." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Я пишу́ учи́телю: the ь of учи́тель becomes ю.
        wrong: Start with я пишу́, then учи́тель: the letter goes to him, and ь becomes ю.

    erase q_teach q_env

    show board

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So whoever something goes to takes the to-ending: you ring to mum, write to your sister, help your brother.
    highlight r1 r2 r3 r4 color #c9871a effect underline

    hide board

B: Я иду́ к ба́бушке! Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon end_gran size 160 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["woman"] icon_look picture of "old woman"
    text end_say "Я иду́ к ба́бушке!" say "Я иду́ к ба́бушке!" say_voice b colors {"е$":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 290 font_size 64

    erase end_masha end_gran end_say

A: Next time: в большо́м до́ме, adjectives in the cases.
